### 7. FIX SUGGESTION SYSTEM
Create `server/src/fixProvider.ts`:

Implements VS Code CodeActionProvider:
- Read from `server/data/fixes/*.yml`
- Match vulnerability type to available fixes
- Return QuickFix actions with:
  - Title: "🔧 Use parameterized query"
  - Edit: WorkspaceEdit that replaces vulnerable code
  - isPreferred: true for high-confidence fixes

Fix template format (fixes/sql-injection-fixes.yml):
```yaml
- vulnerability_type: sql-injection
  fixes:
    - id: parameterized-query
      confidence: high
      title: "Use parameterized query"
      description: "Replace string interpolation with query parameters"
      pattern: 'cursor.execute(f"SELECT * FROM {table} WHERE id={id}")'
      replacement: 'cursor.execute("SELECT * FROM ? WHERE id=?", (table, id))'
      
    - id: orm-migration
      confidence: medium
      title: "Migrate to ORM"
      description: "Use Django ORM for safer queries"
      pattern: 'cursor.execute(*)'
      replacement: 'MyModel.objects.filter(id=id)'
```

